WEBVTT

00:00:01.500 --> 00:00:03.280
I saw a vision!

00:00:03.280 --> 00:00:06.000
Nobunaga is the one who 
can save the world!

00:00:06.550 --> 00:00:09.210
The Savior-King is Nobunaga!

00:00:15.740 --> 00:00:19.510
I will have you give 
me Lady Ichihime.

00:00:19.880 --> 00:00:23.520
I wish to have Lady 
Ichihime as my queen.

00:00:29.730 --> 00:00:31.220
I

00:00:32.360 --> 00:00:34.200
gladly accept.

00:00:41.240 --> 00:00:42.540
Ichihime-sama...

00:00:58.750 --> 00:00:59.850
Mitsuhide!

00:02:57.810 --> 00:02:59.340
What is purpose?!

00:03:01.870 --> 00:03:02.970
Is it just a word?!

00:03:03.310 --> 00:03:04.840
Or does it define how we live?!

00:03:07.280 --> 00:03:10.290
Does it bolster your resolve 
to protect the Oda clan?

00:03:10.290 --> 00:03:11.750
Or do ends merely
justify means?!

00:03:15.330 --> 00:03:16.380
What does purpose mean

00:03:16.380 --> 00:03:17.950
if we can't protect people?!

00:03:47.550 --> 00:03:49.920
Well done, Mitsuhide!

00:03:51.920 --> 00:03:54.220
I am honored, Himiko-sama.

00:03:54.220 --> 00:03:56.370
That is enough for today, isn't it?

00:03:56.370 --> 00:03:59.210
Return my betrothed to me.

00:03:59.210 --> 00:04:01.460
Mitsuhide? Nobu?

00:04:14.180 --> 00:04:15.520
So much sweat.

00:04:15.520 --> 00:04:17.720
Why not take a bath?

00:04:17.720 --> 00:04:20.040
I will help wash it all away.

00:04:20.040 --> 00:04:20.780
All right...

00:04:20.780 --> 00:04:23.130
Come, come.

00:04:24.880 --> 00:04:28.220
Mitsuhide, I have 
not changed my mind.

00:04:29.070 --> 00:04:30.720
I will unite heaven and earth.

00:04:31.660 --> 00:04:33.120
I would expect nothing less.

00:04:34.490 --> 00:04:36.700
If I do not succeed,

00:04:38.090 --> 00:04:39.600
cut me down without hesitation.

00:05:09.300 --> 00:05:11.900
The ley lines are in disarray.

00:05:12.750 --> 00:05:15.070
There is not much time left.

00:05:15.070 --> 00:05:18.670
Caesar has formed an alliance 
with Nobunaga of the Oda clan.

00:05:18.670 --> 00:05:22.040
Caesar increases his
 influence on the Star of the East.

00:05:22.560 --> 00:05:25.120
Furthermore, the girl 
who has visions, Jeanne,

00:05:25.120 --> 00:05:27.300
claims that Nobunaga 
is the Savior-King.

00:05:29.580 --> 00:05:31.280
There you are, Your Majesty.

00:05:33.370 --> 00:05:34.550
Brothers,

00:05:34.940 --> 00:05:38.290
we are here to discuss 
Caesar's actions today.

00:05:39.210 --> 00:05:41.440
Who wishes to speak on this matter?

00:05:41.980 --> 00:05:44.560
It's nothing less than treason.

00:05:44.960 --> 00:05:46.860
That requires no debate.

00:05:46.860 --> 00:05:47.770
If he is not stopped,

00:05:47.770 --> 00:05:50.070
he <i>will</i> turn on us.

00:05:50.070 --> 00:05:53.240
We should order him 
to return immediately,

00:05:53.240 --> 00:05:56.270
charge him with treason 
if he refuses,

00:05:56.270 --> 00:05:58.430
and behead him.

00:05:59.810 --> 00:06:02.210
Well, let us remain calm.

00:06:02.210 --> 00:06:03.930
General Cesare.

00:06:03.930 --> 00:06:05.570
It is said that to fool one's enemy,

00:06:05.570 --> 00:06:07.820
one must first deceive one's allies.

00:06:08.680 --> 00:06:13.320
Caesar may be deceiving 
Nobunaga with clever words

00:06:14.110 --> 00:06:15.680
to offer their five Regalia—

00:06:15.680 --> 00:06:20.330
lightning, fire, wind, 
light, and earth—

00:06:20.780 --> 00:06:26.840
and their four wielders, including 
Nobunaga himself, to His Majesty.

00:06:28.840 --> 00:06:31.120
And by doing so,

00:06:31.120 --> 00:06:36.110
he may be seeking to elevate his 
standing within the Brotherhood.

00:06:36.110 --> 00:06:39.310
Sounds like Caesar, all right.

00:06:39.310 --> 00:06:40.730
In that sense,

00:06:40.730 --> 00:06:44.120
it may very well be true 
that he will backstab us.

00:06:44.840 --> 00:06:49.580
Either way, we should 
ask Caesar himself.

00:06:49.580 --> 00:06:52.960
My, aren't we all bloodthirsty.

00:06:53.480 --> 00:06:56.360
There is something 
of greater concern.

00:06:56.760 --> 00:06:58.500
Concern?

00:06:58.500 --> 00:07:01.350
As you all must be aware,

00:07:01.350 --> 00:07:05.000
I speak of the girl 
from Donremy, Jeanne,

00:07:05.000 --> 00:07:07.510
who went to the East with da Vinci.

00:07:09.050 --> 00:07:10.490
That da Vinci!

00:07:10.490 --> 00:07:12.280
He has forgotten his debt to King Arthur

00:07:12.280 --> 00:07:13.880
and has betrayed us.

00:07:14.360 --> 00:07:17.080
It is true that Nobunaga has

00:07:17.080 --> 00:07:19.440
obtained Giant War Armor 
and gained influence

00:07:19.440 --> 00:07:21.890
because those two
 chose to ally with the Oda.

00:07:21.890 --> 00:07:25.700
Caesar, Nobunaga,
 da Vinci, and Jeanne...

00:07:26.110 --> 00:07:29.160
We cannot afford to ignore them.

00:07:29.750 --> 00:07:32.750
Would it not be possible to 
directly invade the Star of the East,

00:07:32.750 --> 00:07:35.940
now that the ley line 
interference has weakened?

00:07:37.370 --> 00:07:41.270
Indeed, there is little time left.

00:07:48.450 --> 00:07:51.180
The flow of the ley lines is 
undergoing a dramatic change.

00:07:51.960 --> 00:07:54.540
The ley lines of the 
West are weakening.

00:07:54.990 --> 00:07:56.920
They have no time to lose.

00:07:57.420 --> 00:07:58.930
Furthermore,

00:07:58.930 --> 00:08:01.820
the West may invade the East.

00:08:01.820 --> 00:08:03.700
We will counter them.

00:08:03.700 --> 00:08:06.200
We have the Regalia 
and the Amenotorifune.

00:08:06.580 --> 00:08:08.430
If we go all out with our Giant War Armors,

00:08:08.430 --> 00:08:09.700
we can do it!

00:08:12.530 --> 00:08:15.000
Indeed, now may be
 our chance for victory.

00:08:15.000 --> 00:08:16.440
Right, Nobu-sama?

00:08:18.210 --> 00:08:22.940
While the West still underestimates us,
 or me specifically,

00:08:22.940 --> 00:08:24.110
we should strike swiftly

00:08:24.110 --> 00:08:25.820
and fight our way to King Arthur.

00:08:25.820 --> 00:08:27.290
What did he say?

00:08:28.230 --> 00:08:32.750
Our combined Regalia are equal 
to those of the Brotherhood.

00:08:32.750 --> 00:08:34.490
That is the realistic assessment.

00:08:34.490 --> 00:08:40.100
But numbers alone do not 
always determine victory, do they?

00:08:40.100 --> 00:08:42.950
Strategy can change 
the outcome of war—

00:08:42.170 --> 00:08:45.740
Sir Mitsuhide, do you 
still fail to comprehend?

00:08:46.190 --> 00:08:48.130
The outcome of this war 
will be determined by who

00:08:48.130 --> 00:08:49.890
wields the Regalia 
in greater numbers.

00:08:49.890 --> 00:08:51.740
That is the nature of the Regalia.

00:09:00.710 --> 00:09:03.920
The Star of the West is on 
the brink of destruction

00:09:03.920 --> 00:09:05.490
because its ley lines are in disarray.

00:09:05.490 --> 00:09:08.180
For that reason,
 it is quite possible

00:09:08.180 --> 00:09:10.130
that they will invade 
the Star of the East

00:09:10.130 --> 00:09:11.980
in search of new ley lines.

00:09:13.500 --> 00:09:15.160
What do you think?

00:09:16.030 --> 00:09:17.530
I...

00:09:17.530 --> 00:09:18.870
Remember what you said.

00:09:22.040 --> 00:09:24.570
You said Sir Nobunaga 
is the Savior-King.

00:09:24.570 --> 00:09:25.660
I...

00:09:25.660 --> 00:09:28.260
You were led here by your vision

00:09:28.260 --> 00:09:31.950
to confirm whether Sir Nobunaga 
is the true Savior-King.

00:09:32.450 --> 00:09:34.820
Is that not why you 
came to this star?

00:09:36.060 --> 00:09:38.820
Now is the time to 
confirm the truth!

00:09:39.710 --> 00:09:42.360
Whether I am or am not the 
Savior-King is irrelevant.

00:09:46.140 --> 00:09:48.300
I will unify heaven and earth.

00:09:48.860 --> 00:09:51.300
I will do anything in 
order to achieve that.

00:09:52.790 --> 00:09:54.280
That is all.

00:09:54.280 --> 00:09:55.040
I see.

00:09:56.560 --> 00:09:58.080
I want to show you something.

00:10:09.050 --> 00:10:11.320
You were led here by your vision

00:10:11.320 --> 00:10:15.290
to confirm whether Sir Nobunaga 
is the true Savior-King.

00:10:15.620 --> 00:10:18.150
Is that not why you 
came to this star?

00:10:19.740 --> 00:10:20.290
Ranmaru!

00:10:21.130 --> 00:10:22.830
There is something 
I want to ask you.

00:10:23.910 --> 00:10:26.900
What is this "vision" you speak of?

00:10:26.900 --> 00:10:29.600
If it is but an illusion...

00:10:29.600 --> 00:10:32.240
a means to manipulate Nobunaga,

00:10:32.240 --> 00:10:33.550
I will not allow it.

00:10:36.240 --> 00:10:39.120
It is not an illusion.

00:10:39.680 --> 00:10:41.010
I can see visions.

00:10:43.090 --> 00:10:45.210
Ever since I was a girl,

00:10:45.210 --> 00:10:47.540
I have seen many 
visions of the future.

00:10:48.230 --> 00:10:52.990
But no one would believe 
me when I told them.

00:10:53.360 --> 00:10:54.650
And also...

00:10:55.310 --> 00:10:59.000
The visions I spoke of were 
mostly ominous in nature.

00:10:59.550 --> 00:11:05.060
Eventually, people began to say 
that my words brought misfortune.

00:11:05.790 --> 00:11:08.010
It feels as if your power brings misfortune.

00:11:08.560 --> 00:11:11.390
Power... yes.

00:11:11.390 --> 00:11:14.610
That is why I decided not 
to speak of my visions,

00:11:14.610 --> 00:11:16.950
even if they foretold misfortune.

00:11:17.490 --> 00:11:19.740
I could not shake off 
the feeling that I was

00:11:19.740 --> 00:11:21.020
bringing disaster with me.

00:11:21.850 --> 00:11:25.350
But this time,
 that is not the case...

00:11:26.530 --> 00:11:29.900
If Nobunaga is the true Savior-King,

00:11:29.900 --> 00:11:33.300
it will erase the feeling that 
my visions bring only misfortune.

00:11:34.050 --> 00:11:37.300
And the world can be saved.

00:11:38.310 --> 00:11:43.650
That is why, when Caesar said
 that King Arthur is the Savior-King,

00:11:43.650 --> 00:11:45.810
I couldn't help but cry out

00:11:46.360 --> 00:11:48.690
that Nobunaga is
 the true Savior-King.

00:11:50.370 --> 00:11:53.220
That is what I now want to believe.

00:11:57.170 --> 00:12:00.510
Is everyone here?

00:12:00.990 --> 00:12:04.000
Please begin, Lady Hiraga.

00:12:14.160 --> 00:12:17.270
Let us start the trial 
launch right away.

00:12:17.270 --> 00:12:19.020
Are we ready?

00:12:39.400 --> 00:12:40.630
Start whenever you want.

00:12:41.340 --> 00:12:43.110
We will make the four Regalia

00:12:43.110 --> 00:12:46.400
and the Regalia aboard the 
Amenotorifune resonate.

00:12:46.980 --> 00:12:50.150
It will enhance the ship's abilities

00:12:50.150 --> 00:12:53.150
and allow her to 
cross the sea of stars.

00:12:53.150 --> 00:12:54.910
This system will make that possible.

00:13:29.220 --> 00:13:31.980
So this is the greater 
power of the Regalia...

00:13:31.980 --> 00:13:32.790
Yes.

00:13:32.790 --> 00:13:36.870
Well, it is not just my work alone.

00:13:36.870 --> 00:13:40.170
We only achieved this thanks to 
Lady Himiko's ley line research.

00:13:40.170 --> 00:13:41.820
Himiko, are you all right?

00:13:42.200 --> 00:13:43.410
I am fine.

00:13:44.010 --> 00:13:47.700
I just overdid a little in my desire
 to be helpful to you, my betrothed.

00:13:51.160 --> 00:13:54.200
We of the Yamatai had been doing 
this research for a many years,

00:13:54.200 --> 00:13:57.740
but da Vinci-dono really 
moved the analysis forward.

00:13:57.740 --> 00:14:00.390
Your achievements
 should not be discounted.

00:14:00.390 --> 00:14:02.210
I am grateful for your praise.

00:14:02.210 --> 00:14:05.210
It is all thanks to the guidance 
of this star's ley lines.

00:14:06.280 --> 00:14:08.680
I just hope that the 
discord in the Western

00:14:08.680 --> 00:14:10.980
ley lines does not influence our own.

00:14:11.480 --> 00:14:13.700
That will be inevitable.

00:14:13.700 --> 00:14:15.630
Because the ley lines
 there are imbalanced,

00:14:15.630 --> 00:14:16.610
the ley lines here

00:14:16.610 --> 00:14:18.500
are disturbed, 
though it is still minimal.

00:14:18.500 --> 00:14:20.750
If the West attacks,

00:14:20.750 --> 00:14:22.130
we will counter with that ship.

00:14:22.490 --> 00:14:24.000
There is no time to spare.

00:14:24.000 --> 00:14:26.230
We must finish as soon as possible.

00:14:26.560 --> 00:14:27.500
Right.

00:14:31.930 --> 00:14:35.080
We will be entrusting our fates 
to the power of the Regalia

00:14:35.080 --> 00:14:37.880
that was born of 
this peaceful land.

00:14:38.520 --> 00:14:41.810
The peaceful land, Azuchi...

00:14:43.530 --> 00:14:46.610
From now on, that ship 
will be called Azuchi.

00:14:55.200 --> 00:14:59.580
Did you have something 
you wished to ask of me?

00:15:07.370 --> 00:15:08.540
Please.

00:15:16.080 --> 00:15:17.790
Swords, reversed.

00:15:17.790 --> 00:15:20.440
It signifies obstinance, 
willfulness, and assertiveness.

00:15:20.440 --> 00:15:22.960
I wonder whom it
 could be referring to?

00:15:24.560 --> 00:15:25.960
Is it Nobu?

00:15:25.960 --> 00:15:28.810
Or... is it me?

00:15:28.810 --> 00:15:29.560
Who knows...

00:15:30.780 --> 00:15:32.820
What are visions?

00:15:33.280 --> 00:15:35.440
I believe they are a 
form of precognition

00:15:35.440 --> 00:15:39.200
that draws on the quantum flow.

00:15:39.560 --> 00:15:41.580
So they show the future.

00:15:41.580 --> 00:15:48.080
Yes, but the quantum flow is 
affected by human will and decisions,

00:15:48.080 --> 00:15:50.450
so the visions are not certain.

00:15:50.900 --> 00:15:52.140
As in?

00:15:52.140 --> 00:15:53.450
For example, right now...

00:15:53.940 --> 00:15:58.560
You are burdened
 by an irrational issue.

00:15:58.560 --> 00:16:01.460
You drew the card to 
distract yourself from it.

00:16:01.460 --> 00:16:04.590
And, as if to hide your uncertainty,

00:16:04.590 --> 00:16:06.050
you shifted backwards

00:16:06.050 --> 00:16:08.230
and your gaze shifted, as well.

00:16:09.040 --> 00:16:13.200
People move as their heart wills 
them to in search of some answer.

00:16:13.200 --> 00:16:17.170
When Jeanne says that Sir 
Nobunaga is the Savior-King,

00:16:17.170 --> 00:16:21.480
she is already
 willing it to be true.

00:16:32.550 --> 00:16:33.690
This is...

00:16:34.510 --> 00:16:37.130
A painting that represents 
the truth of this world,

00:16:37.130 --> 00:16:40.100
as seen through
 the actions of people.

00:16:43.590 --> 00:16:44.330
What does it say?

00:16:46.530 --> 00:16:50.190
That is all I have to say for now.

00:16:59.510 --> 00:17:02.120
You'll be mistaken for a
 monkey and shot full of arrows.

00:17:02.120 --> 00:17:04.450
Don't rub salt in the wound.

00:17:12.620 --> 00:17:15.540
I heard you crossed 
blades with Nobu-sama.

00:17:15.540 --> 00:17:16.480
Yeah.

00:17:16.480 --> 00:17:20.070
Aren't you fighting the wrong guy?

00:17:20.070 --> 00:17:20.770
What?

00:17:21.320 --> 00:17:23.290
You've always been that way.

00:17:23.290 --> 00:17:24.500
What do you mean?

00:17:25.040 --> 00:17:31.010
You're always shoving how
 you really feel so deep inside

00:17:31.010 --> 00:17:34.580
that you can't find your feelings 
and speak up when it counts.

00:17:34.920 --> 00:17:37.610
I have no idea what 
you're talking about.

00:17:37.610 --> 00:17:40.650
Fine, I'll be blunt.

00:17:40.650 --> 00:17:42.580
I'm talking about Ichihime-sama.

00:17:43.450 --> 00:17:45.830
If you have feelings for 
her, you should just say so.

00:17:46.830 --> 00:17:48.260
Even if you can't just say it,

00:17:48.260 --> 00:17:50.350
you can still let her 
know in other ways.

00:17:50.350 --> 00:17:53.830
But there are times when you
 have to say how you feel in words.

00:17:55.000 --> 00:17:59.030
"Thanks," "sorry," and "I love you,"
 are three examples of that!

00:17:59.030 --> 00:18:01.040
Why are you telling me all this?

00:18:01.730 --> 00:18:04.330
You should've told her sooner!

00:18:04.330 --> 00:18:06.700
Don't be so irresponsible.

00:18:07.310 --> 00:18:08.710
I can't hurt Ichihime-sama—

00:18:08.710 --> 00:18:10.240
Saying something like that

00:18:10.240 --> 00:18:12.280
just proves how 
hopeless you are!

00:18:19.030 --> 00:18:21.410
Ichihime-sama is the 
daughter of a warrior clan.

00:18:21.410 --> 00:18:22.850
She accepted the proposal

00:18:22.850 --> 00:18:24.300
because that's her duty.

00:18:24.650 --> 00:18:26.950
But she's the one
 who's suffering the most

00:18:26.950 --> 00:18:29.830
about having to go to Caesar.

00:18:29.830 --> 00:18:32.370
You should understand 
where she's coming from.

00:18:41.310 --> 00:18:43.210
Is someone there?

00:18:44.330 --> 00:18:45.220
Mitsuhide.

00:18:55.760 --> 00:18:56.980
How apt.

00:18:57.810 --> 00:18:59.570
How busy the flow

00:19:00.180 --> 00:19:01.520
of the river of stars.

00:19:03.840 --> 00:19:05.100
To starry skies

00:19:05.780 --> 00:19:07.760
the night will soon bid

00:19:07.760 --> 00:19:08.970
an empty farewell.

00:19:11.620 --> 00:19:16.980
Please take care of 
Nobu in my stead.

00:19:16.980 --> 00:19:21.580
I doubt I can take your place,
 Ichihime-sama.

00:19:21.580 --> 00:19:23.810
I don't know what might 
have become of the Oda clan

00:19:23.810 --> 00:19:25.990
if you were not with us.

00:19:28.350 --> 00:19:29.920
I do not deserve such kind words.

00:19:30.470 --> 00:19:31.840
Thank you.

00:19:33.030 --> 00:19:36.000
But, I couldn't do anything...

00:19:36.570 --> 00:19:40.000
No, this is all thanks to you.

00:19:49.480 --> 00:19:53.320
I wish to have Lady 
Ichihime as my queen.

00:19:58.910 --> 00:20:00.290
I am sorry.

00:20:02.530 --> 00:20:07.960
I could not protect you,
 Ichihime-sama...

00:20:09.500 --> 00:20:12.970
If only I... If I had...

00:20:15.190 --> 00:20:19.410
I will go to Caesar-dono tomorrow.

00:20:21.420 --> 00:20:24.250
This is strictly for the 
good of the Oda clan,

00:20:24.250 --> 00:20:26.150
our people, and...

00:20:26.150 --> 00:20:29.870
for the peace of our star.

00:20:32.490 --> 00:20:36.530
So, Mitsuhide, stay with Nobu.

00:20:37.560 --> 00:20:39.680
His dream of
 unifying heaven and earth

00:20:39.680 --> 00:20:42.400
is now my dream, as well.

00:20:49.080 --> 00:20:50.140
I understand.

00:20:50.620 --> 00:20:51.840
I promise.

00:20:52.260 --> 00:20:55.270
And, one more thing...

00:21:01.030 --> 00:21:03.690
If anything were to happen to me,

00:21:05.520 --> 00:21:09.290
could you bury this
 comb in Bodaiji Temple?

00:21:27.130 --> 00:21:29.640
I accept this comb.

00:21:30.150 --> 00:21:32.130
But I, Mitsuhide,

00:21:32.730 --> 00:21:35.310
will never let anything
 happen to you, Ichihime-sama.

00:21:36.070 --> 00:21:39.450
I will protect you with my life.

00:21:41.120 --> 00:21:42.240
Mitsuhide...

00:21:45.240 --> 00:21:46.450
Thank you.

00:22:03.580 --> 00:22:04.980
Do you all understand?

00:22:05.570 --> 00:22:07.340
We swear on our honor 
as Kagome agents...

00:22:07.340 --> 00:22:08.910
...to protect Ichihime-sama...

00:22:08.910 --> 00:22:10.910
...with our lives.

00:22:11.860 --> 00:22:13.120
I am counting on you.

00:22:34.930 --> 00:22:36.840
Well, let us proceed.

00:22:37.580 --> 00:22:40.240
Oui, mon impératrice.

00:24:12.270 --> 00:24:15.970
The time to encounter new 
warlords of the West has come.

00:24:15.970 --> 00:24:17.200
Very well!

00:24:17.200 --> 00:24:18.940
We shall engage them!

00:24:19.370 --> 00:24:21.440
Next time: The Empress.

00:24:22.440 --> 00:24:23.940
Wind and clouds, this is urgent.

00:24:24.310 --> 00:24:25.210
Advance!
